    "created_at": "2025-06-27T05:33:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-06-27T05:33:59Z",
    "body": "What was confusing here is that there is no interaction with ECMA-262. This is an HTML algorithm only used by other HTML algorithms, which sometimes throws and sometimes returns a throw completion record.",
